        "description_3wkBCz": {
          "type": "description",
          "settings": {
            "description_text": "<p>Launching a truffle orchard is a long-term, high-value decision. Our role is to make every step of that journey science-driven instead of ad hoc. </p><p>The American Truffle Company partnership is a scientific and business program for qualified growers who want to develop productive, profitable Périgord black truffle orchards. Rather than a one-time consultation or simple tree purchase, you gain structured, tailored guidance, ongoing scientific monitoring, and support all the way through to market via ATC’s established distribution network, for the lifetime of your orchard. </p>"
          }
