      "blocks": {
        "heading_73GTKi": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading_text": "What is the American Truffle Company partnership?",
            "heading_size": "h3",
            "enable_h1_tag": false
          }
        },
        "description_zAjXGh": {
          "type": "description",
          "settings": {
            "description_text": "<p>It is a comprehensive, long-term collaboration in which our scientific team works closely with you to plan, establish, and manage your orchard using proven scientific truffle-growing methods that continue to innovate. The partnership combines full training, codified best practices, and systematic root and orchard monitoring, and brings your high-quality truffles directly to chefs and consumers through ATC’s distribution channels.</p>"
