      "blocks": {
        "heading_mG6mw9": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading_text": "4. Distribution support & market access",
            "heading_size": "h3",
            "enable_h1_tag": false
          }
        },
        "description_P3QJYU": {
          "type": "description",
          "settings": {
            "description_text": "<p>Successful truffle production is only part of the equation. The other part is ensuring that your harvest reaches buyers who value quality without sacrificing profit to third party middlemen. Within the partnership, we provide: </p><ul><li>Guidance on harvest timing and handling to protect quality </li><li>Standards for grading and preparing truffles for premium markets </li><li>Direct access to established distribution relationships, including Michelin level chefs and consumers </li></ul><p>As your partner, our distribution infrastructure takes the guesswork and hard work out of the equation for you. Your truffles are always sold at the highest price possible, directly to consumers and chefs.</p>"
          }
        },
